  bar  head on skull from=0.2 to=0.2 offset=(-0.0241,-0.0141,0.1422) tip=(-0.0108,-0.0069,0.0140) r=0.0055 r2=0.004 blend=0.0015 color=e8a49c gloss=0.75
  bar  head on skull from=0.2 to=0.2 offset=(-0.0125,-0.0023,0.1342) tip=(-0.0156,-0.0046,0.0080) r=0.0062 r2=0.0055 blend=0.0015 color=e8a49c gloss=0.75
